switchboard room whiteboard build: Excalidraw 0.18.1, React and React DOM 18.3.1.
Served by switchboard; no CDN or external font fallback.
Source: https://www.npmjs.com/package/@excalidraw/excalidraw/v/0.18.1
License: https://github.com/excalidraw/excalidraw/blob/v0.18.1/LICENSE
Build: Node 22, esbuild 0.25.12; scripts/board/package-lock.json pins every package.
Rebuild: node scripts/board/build.mjs OUTPUT DEPENDENCY_FOLDER
Install the lockfile with npm ci --ignore-scripts in the dependency folder.
The small frame adapter and browser rules are switchboard's code; upstream code is bundled below.
Patches: the esm.sh font fallback is replaced by /board-assets/; KaTeX's unused browser-inapplicable
CLI-help metadata is removed. Runtime security checks are unchanged.
The main app never loads this bundle; the board document loads it only when opened.
Bundled JS license comments are retained in *.LEGAL.txt. Additional package notices follow.
Fonts are unmodified npm bytes: Virgil, Cascadia, Assistant, Nunito, Lilita, Comic Shanns,
Liberation and Xiaolai use the notices below; Excalifont ships under Excalidraw's MIT license.
Font sources: google/fonts (Assistant, Nunito, Lilita One); microsoft/cascadia-code;
excalidraw/virgil; shannpersand/comic-shanns; liberationfonts/liberation-fonts; lxgw/kose-font.

